      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "WHEN-TO-USE",
      "narration_text": "It fits questions about conflict, time management, problem-solving, and working with people, often phrased as \"tell me about a time.\" Each one asks for a real memory, and STAR gives that memory a shape.",
