      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "STORY-BANK",
      "narration_text": "Don't script per question. Prepare five or six real stories and map each to what it proves: a project you owned, a disagreement, a failure, an ambiguous task, a deadline crunch. One good story often answers several question types.",
